  "bodyHash": "b001b9f9378ddd3f",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Automatic_Tool_Swapper/BH_AT_Title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"289\"></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Automatic_Tool_Swapper/BH_AT_Overview.png\" alt=\"總覽\" width=\"1416\" height=\"114\"></span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组不需要安装在服务器上，只要安装在客户端上即可。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果在快捷栏中挖礦時會自動切換到正確的工具。也適用於其他模组提供的工具。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您想取消切換功能，需要在破坏方块时潜行。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">还有一个快捷键（默认为 G）可切换切换功能的开启与关闭。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NYH2w773S84?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Automatic_Tool_Swapper/BH_AT_Bisect.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"155\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">#广告 #Ad&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">請在 <a href=\"https://github.com/MelanX/ToolSwap/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上报告问题和提供建议。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
